  "releaseNotes": "## v8.0.0 Major feature release\n\n### Bird view\n \n- 10, 11 is now supported, interim .net versions dropped, keep supporting net472 and netstandard2.1\n- Depending on Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions v11\n- Depending on DryIoc v6\n- Support for the keyed services aka IKeyedServiceProvider, IServiceProviderIsKeyedService, KeyedService.AnyKey, ServiceKeyAttribute, FromKeyedServicesAttribute\n- net11: FromKeyedServicesAttribute.LookupMode (inherit the parent key, explicit null key, explicit key)\n\n### Features\n\n- #632 MS DI AddKeyed... variant registration fails\n- #618 Multiple same service key support mostly for DryIoc.MS.DI though it is already supported in DryIoc.MefAttributedModel\n- #612 For the conditional singleton or the singleton registered with AnyKey - should we create a new singleton per condition or the resolution key?\n\n### Fixes\n\n- #706 Implementation factories get the Container instead of the DryIocServiceProvider\n- #484 [MS.DI] ISupportRequiredService is expected to be implemented together with IServiceProvider and not as capability",
